{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45579","headline":"野田黄雀行 · 贯休","name":"野田黄雀行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高树风多，吹尔巢落。\n深蒿叶暖，宜尔依泊。\n莫近鴞类，蛛网亦恶。\n饮野田之清水，食野田之黄粟。\n深花中睡，𡋯土里浴\n如此即全胜啄太仓之谷，而更穿人之屋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}